      "dc:source": "law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nIdentity crimes  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nLaw and Justice Legislation Amendment (Identity Crimes and Other Measures) Act 2011       No.\n3, 2011            3",
      "skos:definition": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nIdentity crimes  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nLaw and Justice Legislation Amendment (Identity Crimes and Other Measures) Act 2011       No.\n3, 2011            3",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011-sec-3-4-norm"
