      },
      "dc:source": "law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The magistrate may issue a certificate under section 375.1 whether\nor not:\n\n(a) the dealer is identifiable; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nSchedule 1  Identity crimes",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The magistrate may issue a certificate under section 375.1 whether\nor not:\n\n(a) the dealer is identifiable; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nSchedule 1  Identity crimes",
