      "values:originalText": "(1) The magistrate may issue a certificate under section 375.1 whether\nor not:\n\n(a) the dealer is identifiable; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nSchedule 1  Identity crimes"
    },
    {
