      },
      "dc:source": "law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "Agreements or understandings\n\n(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the first person:\n\n(i) gives, confers or procures any property, or benefit, of\nany kind to, upon or for another person; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nSchedule 2  Administration of justice offences",
      "skos:definition": "Agreements or understandings\n\n(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the first person:\n\n(i) gives, confers or procures any property, or benefit, of\nany kind to, upon or for another person; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nSchedule 2  Administration of justice offences",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011-sch-2-sec-37-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011-sch-2-sec-37-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a76ea6084be18777f9222a11e960805baf6350f68dee95e8d8b11ef21cb412e8",
      "skos:note": "Giving or conferring property to another person is an offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011#sch-2-sec-37",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "37 Corruption of witnesses",
      "values:kind": "section",
