          "@id": "concept:law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011-sch-2-sec-2011-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011-sch-2-sec-2011-5-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "96063c3a12cfb352b6803392c81505b2de567d0150889be13b44bdea1e47fc07",
      "skos:note": "Abstain from, discontinue or delay a prosecution for an offence; or withhold evidence of an offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011#sch-2-sec-2011-5",
