      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) another person (the prisoner) is in criminal detention;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Conveying a thing into a prison with the intention of facilitating escape is an offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011-sch-2-sec-2011-6-ss-1-logic-deontic-2",
