      "dc:source": "law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011.pdf, p.36",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nAnti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006  Schedule 4\n\nLaw and Justice Legislation Amendment (Identity Crimes and Other Measures) Act 2011       No.\n3, 2011            33\n\n(3A) Subsection (3) does not apply to AUSTRAC information that:\n\n(a) was obtained under section 41; or\n\n(b) was obtained under section 49, in so far as that section relates\nto a communication under section 41; or\n\n(c) was obtained under section 16 of the Financial Transaction\nReports Act 1988.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nAnti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006  Schedule 4\n\nLaw and Justice Legislation Amendment (Identity Crimes and Other Measures) Act 2011       No.\n3, 2011            33\n\n(3A) Subsection (3) does not apply to AUSTRAC information that:\n\n(a) was obtained under section 41; or\n\n(b) was obtained under section 49, in so far as that section relates\nto a communication under section 41; or\n\n(c) was obtained under section 16 of the Financial Transaction\nReports Act 1988.",
      "cml:asserts": [
