    {
      "@id": "concept:law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011-sch-4-sec-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8 Application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011#sch-4-sec-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011.pdf, p.37",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments of section 62 of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this Schedule apply in\nrelation to aircraft or ships leaving a place outside Australia on or after\nthe commencement of this item.\n(2)\nThe amendment of section 124 of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this Schedule applies\nin relation to court or tribunal proceedings instituted on or after the\ncommencement of this item.\n(3)\nThe amendment of section 128 of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this Schedule applies\nin relation to information obtained under section 16 of the Financial\nTransaction Reports Act 1988 before, on or after the commencement of\nthis item.\n(4)\nThe amendments of sections 130 and 131 of the Anti-Money\nLaundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this\nSchedule apply in relation to AUSTRAC information obtained before,\non or after the commencement of this item.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nSchedule 5  Australian Federal Police Act 1979",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments of section 62 of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this Schedule apply in\nrelation to aircraft or ships leaving a place outside Australia on or after\nthe commencement of this item.\n(2)\nThe amendment of section 124 of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this Schedule applies\nin relation to court or tribunal proceedings instituted on or after the\ncommencement of this item.\n(3)\nThe amendment of section 128 of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this Schedule applies\nin relation to information obtained under section 16 of the Financial\nTransaction Reports Act 1988 before, on or after the commencement of\nthis item.\n(4)\nThe amendments of sections 130 and 131 of the Anti-Money\nLaundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this\nSchedule apply in relation to AUSTRAC information obtained before,\non or after the commencement of this item.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nSchedule 5  Australian Federal Police Act 1979",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011-sch-4-sec-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011-sch-4-sec-8-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b8b06862d48623acdd2996daf717eb7d4334306bc859edb1d0602da570896172",
      "skos:note": "Application of amendments to anti-money laundering and counter-terrorism financing acts"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011#sch-4-sec-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 Application",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 37,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments of section 62 of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this Schedule apply in\nrelation to aircraft or ships leaving a place outside Australia on or after\nthe commencement of this item.\n(2)\nThe amendment of section 124 of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this Schedule applies\nin relation to court or tribunal proceedings instituted on or after the\ncommencement of this item.\n(3)\nThe amendment of section 128 of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this Schedule applies\nin relation to information obtained under section 16 of the Financial\nTransaction Reports Act 1988 before, on or after the commencement of\nthis item.\n(4)\nThe amendments of sections 130 and 131 of the Anti-Money\nLaundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this\nSchedule apply in relation to AUSTRAC information obtained before,\non or after the commencement of this item.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nSchedule 5  Australian Federal Police Act 1979"
    },
