      "values:originalText": "The amendment made by item 18 applies in relation to service\noccurring before, on or after the commencement of that item.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nJudiciary Act 1903  Schedule 6\n\nLaw and Justice Legislation Amendment (Identity Crimes and Other Measures) Act 2011       No.\n3, 2011            37",
      "skos:definition": "The amendment made by item 18 applies in relation to service\noccurring before, on or after the commencement of that item.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nJudiciary Act 1903  Schedule 6\n\nLaw and Justice Legislation Amendment (Identity Crimes and Other Measures) Act 2011       No.\n3, 2011            37",
      "cml:asserts": [
