      "dc:source": "law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011.pdf, p.41",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(2) The CEO must be a person whose name is on:\n\n(a) the roll of barristers and solicitors of the High Court kept\nunder the Rules of Court; or\n\n(b) the roll of barristers, solicitors, barristers and solicitors or\nlegal practitioners of the Supreme Court of a State or\nTerritory.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nSchedule 7  Miscellaneous amendments",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(2) The CEO must be a person whose name is on:\n\n(a) the roll of barristers and solicitors of the High Court kept\nunder the Rules of Court; or\n\n(b) the roll of barristers, solicitors, barristers and solicitors or\nlegal practitioners of the Supreme Court of a State or\nTerritory.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003\n\nSchedule 7  Miscellaneous amendments",
      "cml:asserts": [
